{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9874","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9874/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9874/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9874/events","html_url":"https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9874","id":1064555402,"node_id":"I_kwDOAGhaic4_c9OK","number":9874,"title":"[Promtool] `promtool check config` doesn't properly check `bearer_token_file` file existence","user":{"login":"zzehring","id":7545035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NDUwMzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7545035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzehring","html_url":"https://github.com/zzehring","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzehring/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzehring/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzehring/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzehring/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzehring/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzehring/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzehring/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzehring/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzehring/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":365563588,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNjU1NjM1ODg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/labels/kind/bug","name":"kind/bug","color":"ff0000","default":false,"description":null},{"id":366192871,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNjYxOTI4NzE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/labels/component/promtool","name":"component/promtool","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":null},{"id":647013637,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NDcwMTM2Mzc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/labels/priority/P3","name":"priority/P3","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2021-11-26T14:46:29Z","updated_at":"2022-05-29T23:21:31Z","closed_at":"2021-11-30T04:02:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**What did you do?**\r\n\r\nWhile working on #5222, I was trying to reproduce the error with `bearer_token_file`. I ran `promtool check config $my_config` against a config file that has `bearer_token_file` set to a path to a file that doesn't exist.\r\n\r\n**What did you expect to see?**\r\n\r\nPromtool should fail, as it explicitly checks if a file exists for the `bearer_token_file` path.\r\n\r\n**What did you see instead? Under which circumstances?**\r\n\r\nPromtool check succeeded. During unmarshalling of configs, they'll call `c.HTTPClientConfig.Validate()`. This [validate function moves](https://github.com/prometheus/common/blob/ce7006ede1b27960d267508d7ae0af2f51422610/config/http_config.go#L243-L252) the `bearer_token_file` info to `Authorization.CredentialsFile` and sets `bearer_token_file` to `\"\"`. So when promtool goes to check the config struct, it [only checks the `bearer_token_file`](https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/blob/b48a1e9e9bc3575e2f6ef3e7ea8573434288e0bb/cmd/promtool/main.go#L356-L358) which is set to empty string.\r\n\r\nIf we want to keep the same functionality, we need to update this check to look at `config.HTTPClientConfig.Authorization.CredentialsFile` instead.\r\n\r\n**Environment**\r\n\r\n* System information:\r\n\r\nDarwin 21.0.1 arm64\r\n\r\n* Prometheus version:\r\n\r\nprometheus, version 2.32.0-beta.0 (branch: main, revision: 4cae788689121b624557c63d955fbffeef1a91e9)\r\n  build user:       Me\r\n  build date:       20211123-18:19:06\r\n  go version:       go1.17.3\r\n  platform:         darwin/arm64","closed_by":{"login":"dgl","id":5385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgl","html_url":"https://github.com/dgl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dgl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9874/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/9874/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}